":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:06:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T13:52:18Z","closed_at":"2025-04-02T13:52:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm looping through and creating MeshInstance3D nodes through code. I have code containing several textures. In many cases, the same texture is used. In order to break up monotony, I've elected to modify the uv1_offset of the textures by random in code.\n\n```\n\tvar rng = randi_range(1, textures.texture[block_type + \"_texture_count\"])\n\tmesh_block.set_surface_override_material(0, textures.texture[block_type][rng])\n\tvar mesh_material = mesh_block.get_surface_override_material(0)\n\tvar uv1v: float = 60.0\n\tmesh_material.uv1_offset = Vector3(randf_range(-uv1v, uv1v), randf_range(-uv1v, uv1v), randf_range(-uv1v, uv1v))\n```\n\nThis code works great. It chooses a texture appropriately and that works fine. However, the uv1_offset changes ALL instances of this node. In the MeshInstance, I've ticked \"Local to Scene\" on both the Mesh itself (using a BoxMesh) and the material override that gets changed. Doesn't matter.\n\nAm I just doing something incorrectly here?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create MeshInstance3D node.\n- Instantiate many of these nodes in code.\n- Have material override modified for MeshInstance3D's in code.\n- Change uv1_offset of MeshInstance3D's in code.\n- Select \"Local to Scene\" for the Material Override.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103532/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}